# False positives with no backing installed file (PkgPath is null in Trivy's
# own JSON output) — verified inside the built image:
#   - setuptools is actually 84.0.0 (well past the 78.1.1 fix), confirmed via
#     `python -c "import setuptools; print(setuptools.__version__)"`.
#   - msgpack isn't installed at all: `import msgpack` raises ModuleNotFoundError.
# Both appear to come from a stale/internal pip manifest scan, not a real
# file on disk. Re-verify (remove this ignore and re-scan) after any base
# image or pip version bump.
